{"title": "Defensive Attack", "pageid": 28018, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Defensive_Attack", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the reaction. For the corresponding passive feature, see <a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Attack_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Defensive Attack (passive feature)\">Defensive Attack (passive feature)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Defensive_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Defensive_Attack.webp/300px-Defensive_Attack.webp, /w/images/4/49/Defensive_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Defensive_Attack.webp/300px-Defensive_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Defensive_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Defensive Attack</b> is a free reaction that can be taken when making the first attack with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defender_Greataxe\" title=\"Defender Greataxe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defender_Greataxe\" title=\"Defender Greataxe\">Defender Greataxe</a> in a turn. It temporarily sacrifices one <a href=\"/wiki/Enchantment\" title=\"Enchantment\">Enchantment</a> level from the axe to grant the wielder +1 AC and saving throws.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nAt the start of a round, you can reduce the weapon's additional attack bonus by 1 to increase your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> by 1.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Defensive_Stance\"> Condition: Defensive Stance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Stance_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Stance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defensive Stance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Stance_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Stance (Condition)\">Defensive Stance</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>You have +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defender_Greataxe\" title=\"Defender Greataxe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Defender_Greataxe\" title=\"Defender Greataxe\">Defender Greataxe</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This reaction is only triggered when making the first attack with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defender_Greataxe\" title=\"Defender Greataxe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Greataxe_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defender_Greataxe\" title=\"Defender Greataxe\">Defender Greataxe</a> in a round. Subsequent attacks do not give an opportunity to activate this action.</li>\n<li>The -1 penalty to attack rolls from this effect is applied to the attack that triggers the reaction. The confirmation prompt for the reaction shows the attack roll and AC of the target, so one can decline the reaction if turning a hit into a miss.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715055209\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3410/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37119/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16363/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1061605/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n116.70%   85.971     45 Template:Trim\n100.00%   73.667      1 -total\n 98.79%   72.772      1 Template:Feature_page\n 31.57%   23.254      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 26.01%   19.159      3 Template:Item_icon\n 12.50%    9.205      1 Template:Condition\n 12.06%    8.882      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.73%    7.903     11 Template:Ifempty\n  9.56%    7.041      5 Template:Icon_text\n  7.28%    5.363      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28018-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715055209 and revision id 292862. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}